# LoTSS DR3 tile-query manifest (plan Phase 6A.S5.T3).
# Generated by crates/gororoba_cli_data/src/bin/lotss_enumerate.rs.
# Refresh: `make lotss-tiles-refresh` (future target).
# Consumed by a future fetch binary that issues cone-search queries
# against https://vo.astron.nl/hetdex/q with 250 ms inter-request
# delay (per registry/data_servers.toml#lotss_vo).
#
# Schema per docs/adr/lotss-footprint-policy.md.

